            "title": "BofA backs 4% crypto allocation, while this crypto bull says 40%",
            "description": "<p>Bank of America (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BAC\">BAC</a>) says its wealth management clients <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/bank-of-america-says-its-wealth-management-clients-may-put-up-to-4-of-their-portfolio-in-crypto-220028738.html\">should consider adding some crypto exposure</a> to their portfolios, endorsing an allocation of up to 4%.</p>\n<p>Ric Edelman, Digital Assets Council of Financial Professionals (DACFP) founder and \"The Truth About Crypto\" bestselling author, sits down with Market Catalysts host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/\">Julie Hyman</a> to discuss evolving sentiment around crypto on Wall Street and what the biggest risk is to his bullish crypto outlook.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-catalysts/\">Market Catalysts</a>.</p>",
